      "title": "Merged PR #15008: HW/WiimoteReal: Fix crash when UI disconnects a Balance Board.",
      "url": "https://github.com/dolphin-emu/dolphin/pull/15008",
      "source": "Dolphin merged PR",
      "publisher": "dolphin-emu/dolphin",
      "description": "Toggling off `Real Balance Board` triggers `Config::OnConfigChanged` which invokes `~Wiimote()` which invoked `RemoveConfigChangedCallback`. Despite `s_callbacks_lock` being a `recursive_mutex`, `OnConfigChanged` is really not prepared for callbacks to be added/removed from within another callback and this will generally cause a crash from invalide",
