      "title": "GPD Win Mini Ultra Pricing Confirmed: Intel Arc G3 Extreme Handheld Starts at $1,699",
      "url": "https://www.techpowerup.com/355075/gpd-win-mini-ultra-pricing-confirmed-intel-arc-g3-extreme-handheld-starts-at-usd-1-699",
      "source": "TechPowerUp",
      "publisher": "TechPowerUp",
